OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham sets out Labour's
OL,4,Apitch to London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe party conference season is under
OL,7,Fway - with the Labour Party meeting in
OL,8,FLiverpool this week.
OL,10,FBBC London's political editor Karl
OL,11,FMercer is sitting down with leaders and
OL,12,Fother senior party figures to discuss
OL,13,Fsome of the key issues facing the
OL,14,Fcapital, and what their party might do
OL,15,Fto tackle them.
OL,17,FOn Friday he spoke to Labour Party
OL,18,Fleader and Prime Minister Andy Burnham,
OL,19,Fand asked about the party's performance
OL,20,Fin May's local elections and London's
OL,21,Flack of progress on housebuilding.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
