OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham sets out Labour's
OL,4,Apitch to London
OL,5,
OL,6,FKarl Mercer: Are you in danger of
OL,7,Flosing support in London? Voters gave
OL,8,Fyou a bit of a spanking in May, you
OL,9,Flost half your councils, a third of
OL,10,Fyour councillors, and they've turned to
OL,11,Fthe Greens and back to the Tories
OL,12,Finstead of Labour.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
